{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50178","headline":"题雍丘崔明府丹竈（伯二五六七。下同） · 李昂","name":"题雍丘崔明府丹竈（伯二五六七。下同）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闻君小邑蹔鸣弦，隐几灰心有岁年。\n白石既烧应化鹤，黄金未熟且烹鲜。\n鑪中近染三花气，树里新飞五色烟。\n伊尹即今须负鼎，王乔何事欲冲天。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50178.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50178","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}